---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - SSE Interview Questions">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">About SSE Interview Questions</h1>
    
    <div class="prose prose-lg">
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        SSE Interview Questions is a comprehensive resource for preparing for technical interviews at top tech companies.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">What We Cover</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>System Design Architecture</li>
        <li>Data Structures & Algorithms</li>
        <li>Database Design & Optimization</li>
        <li>Distributed Systems Concepts</li>
        <li>Cloud Platforms & DevOps</li>
        <li>Programming Language Specifics</li>
        <li>Network Protocols & Communication</li>
        <li>Security Best Practices</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">How to Use This Resource</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-2 text-gray-700">
        <li>Browse topics by category</li>
        <li>Read through interview questions and problem statements</li>
        <li>Study the provided solutions and explanations</li>
        <li>Practice implementing solutions from scratch</li>
        <li>Review key concepts and patterns</li>
      </ol>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Contributing</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700">
        This resource is open source and community-driven. If you'd like to contribute questions, solutions, or improvements,
        please visit our GitHub repository.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
